 paragraph(refs,'Repository navigation baseline: local CodeGraph commit bec77ed044d3ace42366c8143444fa82dafde7aa; MCP index 5156046ea90c3cb9c79c64365fa89f55f3b2a8c5. Sources: CodeGraphWeb/src/app/app.routes.ts and pages/repo-detail, node-list, node-detail, and graph. See design-coverage.json for exact files. The native rewrite remains unimplemented.')
 rows.append(['Prompt caching','Official API guidance consulted 31 October 2026: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/prompt-caching and https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-caching . Stable rendered prefixes, tool/message structure, capability-specific controls and observable usage inform CACHE 01–06. Exact subscription and compatible-endpoint support requires validation.'])
 rows.append(['GitHub polling','Official GitHub guidance consulted 31 October 2026: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/using-the-rest-api/best-practices-for-using-the-rest-api and https://docs.github.com/en/webhooks/webhook-events-and-payloads . Authenticated conditional polling is selected under GH-10; unchanged 304 responses avoid the primary rate limit when correctly authorized. The webhook event catalog informs domain-event coverage, not a commitment to receive webhooks. Poll cadence and exact endpoint/event mappings require implementation validation.'])
 rows.append(['Next work allocation','CodeGraph indexed/local Git-object commit afe73560215bbe7593fc59451de5cc3237e3eeca: src/CodeGraph.Services/Work/WorkTools.cs, src/CodeGraph.Data.MariaDb/MySqlWorkStore.Writes.cs, and WorkTrackingMariaDbTests/WorkConcurrencyMariaDbTests. Current next_work claims tasks across a project, optionally filtered by feature; it has priority ordering, atomic claims and idempotent retries. WORK-09 extends project scope to select features and standalone issues from one priority queue. Exact new allocation/start contracts remain proposed under WORK-10.'])
 rows.append(['Branch overlays','CodeGraph indexed commit afe73560215bbe7593fc59451de5cc3237e3eeca, verified from local Git objects: src/CodeGraph.Services/Overlays/BranchOverlayService.cs, OverlayGraphView.cs and CommitScope.cs; src/CodeGraph.Tests/Services/BranchOverlayServiceTests.cs and OverlayQueryTests.cs. Source overlays are commit-based, compose changed files over the default index, and report stale/missing views. Automatic uncommitted worktree overlays are the confirmed harness extension. Source tests were inspected, not executed.'])
 rows.append(['Historical HydraDB naming','Official documentation consulted 31 October 2026: https://github.com/hydra-db/hydradb-mcp/blob/main/README.md . Graph tools expose collections and unrestricted Cypher, with no schema tool; structural discovery requires queries. The earlier HydraDB name was corrected to HelixDB. Neither HydraDB nor HelixDB is a current target. The later user decision removes the conditional HelixDB reader under DB-06–07; retain this naming history only as provenance.'])
