 for b in find('23 ')['blocks']:
  if b[0]=='table':
   b[2].append(['Harness package lifecycle','Ask an agent to build a package with a custom tool, command, event-driven verification step, context contribution and native findings panel. Verify development/test evidence and version-bound approval: reject one version, approve another, and confirm only the approved contents activate at a safe boundary without rebuilding the host. Manage language packs and harness packages in one Add-ons screen. Verify scope, requested/effective access, configuration, enable/disable/update/uninstall, package state and version attribution after restart, and guarded rollback. Exercise hook failure, cancellation and recovery without duplicate external effects or stalled unrelated work. Package host calls must preserve router use, read-only reviewer restrictions, required review gates, transcript history and context/cache rules. Prebuilt installation does not require a compiler or a TypeScript runtime. Existing Pi/Oh My Pi packages must not be presented as compatible without a separately validated adapter. EXT 01–06; ADDON 01–04; TOOL 01–05; ROUTE 01; CACHE 01–06; CONTEXT 04–06; SET 05–06; SKILL 07–09.'])
