 for b in find('23 ')['blocks']:
  if b[0]=='table':
   b[2].append(['Keep working with fresh sessions','Create a project: keep-working is off by default. Explicitly enable it with several eligible features and standalone issues: run only one work item at a time per project, then automatically select/start the next by priority after completion. Verify internal subagent concurrency remains available and two projects can work independently. Automatic selection skips incomplete or unapproved features; explicit Start may separately develop a plan and request approval. Pauses, budgets, permissions, resources, ownership and manual-resume holds remain effective. After closing/reopening, keep-working stays stopped until manually restarted. Exhaust eligible work: the mode stops. Add eligible work afterward: it remains stopped until manually enabled again. Every newly started item gets a distinct session with its own work brief, applicable instructions and scoped context; the prior item’s conversation must not become its transcript. Verify this for keep-working, scheduled and manually started work and newly delegated task assignments, preserving source-action/history links. Continue an existing paused item and verify its established history and continuity instead. Inspect mode controls and activity. AGENT 01–02, 10–17; WORK 09–10; CONTEXT 01–06; CONTROL 08–11; JOB 07.'])
