   b[2].append(['Preferred repository directory','Set, save and reopen the app-wide repository base directory. Verify a project inherits it, set a project override, and verify that project uses its override while other projects still inherit. Clear the override and verify inheritance returns. Under the proposed path behavior, validate unavailable locations, use the default for a new clone, retain repositories elsewhere, and verify changing the base does not move existing repositories or change their recorded paths. SET 01–02, 07–08.'])
