 for b in find('23 ')['blocks']:
  if b[0]=='table':b[2].append(['Human and agent Help','Open Help near Settings; search for UI actions, configuration scope, autonomous workflows, recovery and extension development. Follow each screen and Settings-section Help link and verify it opens the relevant local topic. Verify documentation covers implemented behavior and every supported extension point, with usable package/language-pack development examples. Retrieve the same topics through coordinator, worker and reviewer documentation tools, subject to configured permissions; documentation cannot grant writes or override user directions. Validate coverage and freshness against the working product. Disconnect networking and verify Help browsing/search and agent retrieval remain available entirely locally, including installed add-on guides; verify documentation versions match the installed app/add-ons. HELP 01–06; TOOL 01–05; EXT 01–06; ADDON 01–04.'])
