 paragraph(find('22 '),'Document RAG is required under RAG-01; Markdown, plain text, PDF and Word support is confirmed under RAG-09. Routed vision fallback for scanned/image-only pages is enabled by default and configurable in Settings under RAG-10. Document scope defaults to the current project, with explicit cross-project sharing and Move to project controls under RAG-11. Initial Word scope is modern .docx only under RAG-09, and version retention is settled under RAG-13. Qualify vision quality targets, precise sharing controls, adding without a current project, replacement mechanics, optional watchers/URL ingestion, lexical/vector ranking and graph expansion, embedding configuration, source lifecycle/retention and measurable retrieval quality. OxiRS is a candidate only; selected reuse and any RDF/SPARQL adaptation must be validated without silently changing the selected SQLite/sqlite-vec architecture. Imported documents are retained managed project artifacts under RAG-12. Details under RAG-02–08 remain proposed.')
