 ['G04','Enforcement. Full default, verified reviewer reads, host authority/revocation, dedicated repository deletion and fail-closed restricted admission are adopted. Qualify actual destructive/credential/outbound/process/confinement races and each target.'],
 ['G05','Extensions. Framed native host/SDK contracts, all eight contribution types, signed trust, scoped callbacks, quiescent registry/state publication and guarded rollback are adopted. Qualify actual interoperability, authority, failure recovery and target packaging.'],
 ['G06','Scope and retrieval. Exact source views, overlay masking, current scope filtering, immutable source citations, retained document versions and checked publication are adopted. Qualify complete cross-repository/rename/delete/uncommitted behavior and reference-aware cleanup.'],
