 ['G08','Documents and databases. Modern .docx, Markdown/text and pinned native PDF candidates are selected. Relational targets are SQLite, MariaDB, MySQL, PostgreSQL and SQL Server. HelixDB schema reading is removed; DW-038 is retired. Qualify format/metadata/read-only coverage and source retention.'],
